obo:FLOPO_0980598 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "chestnut colour sensu Saccardo (1891)"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A colour quality recognized according to Saccardo's Chromotaxia within category 10 by resemblance to the pericarp or seed coat of Castanea sativa."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Use only when Saccardo's nomenclature or category 10 is specified. FLOPO-local source-qualified colour quality; its generic colour is PATO:0104329 (chestnut colour). The natural exemplar varies and Saccardo groups several brown names in category 10."@en ;
