    rdfs:label "chestnut sensu Ridgway (1912)"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A colour quality recognized according to Ridgway's 1912 standard by closest match to Chestnut chip II 9m; Hamly gives the approximate legacy conversion Munsell 10R 3.0/5.0."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Use only when Ridgway 1912 or chip II 9m is specified. FLOPO-local source-qualified colour quality; its generic colour is PATO:0104329 (chestnut colour). Ridgway's Chestnut is distinct from his Chestnut-Brown."@en ;
